3588 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Payless started with a simple observation\072 phone theft isn\047t really a hardware problem\054 it\047s an information problem\056 A stolen phone works exactly the same as a clean one \024 the only thing missing is a way for the next buyer to know the difference\056\n\nWe built Payless to close that gap\056 It\047s free to check a phone\054 free to report one stolen\054 and built to work reliably even on a slow connection at a busy market stall\056 We started in Ilorin and we\047re growing city by city \024 because trust works best when it\047s local\054 and a face\055to\055face handshake still beats any app\056)
     /K [ 71 ]
     /P 3589 0 R
     /Pg 3446 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
